  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "\xA1Jefe! Remember me? Interview guy. I got there at noon, the job was gone.
    But the owner felt bad. Trial day today. So!"
  - The registration's mine now, look. Neto signed it over. Cost me a carne asada
    and four hours of listening to Neto.
  - The box? Brake rotors. For a guy at the shop. Very legal. Very boring.
  - Some guys at the gas station asked if I cross every day. I said yeah. They said
    "good." Just "good." Weird, right?
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1Gracias, jefe! See you tomorrow. Same Chuy, same truck. Same
    time!"
  lineIfRejected: But it's MINE now! Neto signed it! ...Okay. Okay. Tomorrow, then.
  lineIfImprisoned: Brake rotors, jefe! They're BRAKE ROTORS! Ask anyone! Ask a car!
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 0}
