  returnVisits:
  - earlierVisit: {fileID: 11400000, guid: abea7859380c2bd44b66d5c4d296138e, type: 2}
    decisionThen: 0
    boothLines:
    - "\xA1Jefe! It's me! I GOT THE JOB! Diesel mechanic! Look at my hands. Real
      grease. Professional grease."
    - The registration's mine now, look. Neto signed it over. Cost me a carne asada
      and four hours of listening to Neto.
    - The box? Brake rotors. For a guy at the shop. Very legal. Very boring.
    - Some guys at the gas station asked if I cross every day. I said yeah. They
      said "good." Just "good." Weird, right?
  - earlierVisit: {fileID: 11400000, guid: abea7859380c2bd44b66d5c4d296138e, type: 2}
    decisionThen: 2
    boothLines:
    - Jefe. It's me. They let me out this morning. Neto came with the papers. He
      cried more than me. A lot more.
    - The registration's mine now, look. Neto signed it over. Cost me a carne asada
      and four hours of listening to Neto.
    - The box? Brake rotors. For a guy at the shop. Very legal. Very boring.
    - Some guys at the gas station asked if I cross every day. I said yeah. They
      said "good." Just "good." Weird, right?
